        "original_id": "0de2bc23-884d-5d63-bd06-774c596d6c8f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dappy, Costadinos Contostavlos, Tobias Sammet\n- Music Groups/Projects: N-Dubz, Avantasia, Edguy\n- Music Releases: Greatest Hits, No Regrets\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, rapper, actor, musician, music producer\n\nFacts:\n- Tobias Sammet was born on 21 November 1977 and is a German musician, singer, songwriter, and music producer.\n- Tobias Sammet is best known as the founder of Avantasia and as the singer and primary songwriter of Edguy.\n- Costadinos Contostavlos was born on 11 June 1987 and is better known by the stage name Dappy.\n- Dappy is an English singer, songwriter, rapper, and actor.\n- Greatest Hits is an N-Dubz album that includes fourteen of the group's singles, excluding \"Feva Las Vegas\" and \"We Dance On\".\n- Greatest Hits also includes one album track, two live lounge covers, and the original N-Dubz version of Dappy's first solo single, \"No Regrets\".",
